==English==

===Etymology===
From {{L.}} ''[[sine#Latin|sine]]'' ("[[without]]") + ''[[die#Latin|die]]'', the {{ablative}} {{singular}} of ''[[dies]]'' (meaning "[specific] [[day]]"). Literally meaning "[[without]] a [specific] [[day]]".

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# [[without]] [[specifying]] a [[date]] (for a [[future]] [[event]]); [[indefinitely]]

